# One dola.com account cookie per line (must contain all three fields msToken= / s_v_web_id= / sessionid=)
# How to obtain: log in to https://www.dola.com, then F12 -> Network -> any request -> Headers -> the full Cookie
# A line starting with # is a comment. Example (placeholder — replace with a real cookie):
# msToken=xxxx; s_v_web_id=ver_xxxx; sessionid=xxxx; passport_auth_status=xxxx; sid_guard=xxxx
